  "image_path": "UI/Sprite/A1DynamicLoad/BossCard/UnPacker/BossCardLv04/Monster_Mutant.png",
  "name": "Phaethon of the Scorched Horizon",
  "desc": "Light descends before the agony.\nUncontrollable Ether erupts like a solar corona. The silhouette of what was once \"human\" is burned, disintegrated, and reshaped into an aberration resembling an Ethereal. Crystalline lenses tremble deep within their vision, spilling excess radiance — too bright, too close, as if someone had embedded the blazing sun into their eye sockets.\nConsciousness wears thin amidst the burning.\nThe swing ends — like a reflex, like a habit, lacking even the concept of a target. There is only a suffocatingly familiar blankness, as if long ago, they had also lost their voice and weight like this, watching everything plummet amidst the light and heat. Those buried fragments surge upward along the residual flames: the cold glare of the lab table, the sudden uncontrollable force, the faces drained of life... The memories are sickeningly vivid, leaving indelible scorch marks on the mind.\n...Who is calling out?\nThat voice pierces the roar of blood rushing in the ears, briefly striking a faded name and granting their consciousness a momentary respite. Before their sanity is completely incinerated, a choice must be made — don't bring about another disaster. Go away. Leave... leave...\n...Where to? With whom? To do what?\n......\n...Ah, I think we did make a deal like that...\n...\"We shall catch the 'sun'.\"\n\n\"To think your original sin would lead me to new heights over a decade later... How ironic, you legacy of 'Helios'.\"",
  "rarity": 4,
  "group_id": 290,
  "group_desc": "Special",
  "card_obtain": "[Unidentified] Defeat this monster in Hollow Zero 1 time to obtain its data",
  "card_quote": "— An old man holding the Lead Scepter is reviewing the tournament's confidential reports",
  "card_skill_desc": "In combat, Scorched Horizon can utilize its extraordinary mastery of Ether to reconstruct itself multiple times, simulating the attack patterns and corresponding attributes of various Etheric Irregularities. Scorched Horizon will activate Gale Scorcher at specific moments to enhance its attacks, generating tornadoes on the battlefield to fight by its side. Meanwhile, Scorched Horizon will enter the Windswept state. If another Attribute Anomaly is inflicted it will trigger Vortex and render it Impaired.",
